    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "The call control max calls index must be equal to the friend number/index assigned to a new friend: \nhttps://github.com/TokTok/toxic/blob/master/src/audio_call.c#L1090 \nhttps://github.com/TokTok/toxic/blob/master/src/friendlist.c#L618\n\nThis works fine until you start shuffling friendnumbers around by deleting or blocking contacts. The way friendnumbers are assigned differs from the way call control indices are assigned. Once assigned friendnumbers are no longer aligned with their respective call control index, any newly added friend will not be able to initialize AV. \n\nThe only temporary fix for this is to restart Toxic.\n\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-02-11T21:26:50Z",
